 seven points in surveys from Research & Polling and SurveyUSA, and holds an enormous money advantage, having raised roughly $11 million to Hull's under $500,000. Rating outlets mostly call the race Likely or Solid Democratic, and prediction markets put her chances near 95 percent. Hull has struggled to gain traction, and the two candidates never agreed on a debate. The main open question is the size of Haaland's victory rather than the winner.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 10.58}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9605, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.948, "margin": 10.2}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9415, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9552, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9463, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9506, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9606, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9549, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9273, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9256, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9234, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9268, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.923, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9163, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9351, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9301, "margin": 8.5}]}